WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.400
A triangle gets a name for its sides and one for its angles.

2
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.225
No two sides are the same: scalene. Every angle is under ninety: acute.

3
00:00:10.929 --> 00:00:16.054
Move one corner until two sides match. The ticks show it is isosceles.
